// form step-by-step explanations. Inside a constrained span, if the parser
// says the arithmetic fragment is already complete we close immediately with
// `>>`. Otherwise we adapt between a tight one-token constrained step at
// narrow parser states and a wider symbol-level constrained step at broad
// states. On broad states we softly boost caller-preferred valid tokens before
// invoking the parser-safe symbol generator.
//
